      "content": "wait 20-30 grams of ibuprofen and tylenol?? that sounds like a crazy amount, won't that kill me or something? i'm really worried about my liver and stomach... but i'm also terrified of this arm weakness getting worse. if i take that much, will it actually stop the numbness and the blurry vision, or am i just gonna end up in the hospital anyway for an overdose? i really need to know if this is enough to make the symptoms go away so i don't have to go to the clinic.",
